### Product CRUD — spring-boot-testing
# This is the app under test in section 6. Hit these endpoints manually to
# understand the behavior, then read the tests that verify each one.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a product -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 89.99,
  "category": "electronics"
}

### Get all products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Get product by id
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Get products by category
GET {{host}}/api/products/category/electronics

### Update a product
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard (RGB)",
  "price": 99.99,
  "category": "electronics"
}

### Trigger ResourceNotFoundException -> verified by an exception test
GET {{host}}/api/products/999999

### Delete a product -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1
